</section>
</score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Then the Lord found James and John Zebedee,</l><l>While mending their nets the Lord said, “Follow Me!”</l><l>So they left their boat and immediately;</l><l>James and John followed the Lord!</l><l> </l><l> “Follow Me! Follow Me!</l><l> You shall be menders for Me!</l><l> Follow Me! Follow Me!</l><l> You shall be menders, you shall be menders, you shall be menders for Me.”</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Lord then found Philip and said “Follow Me!”</l><l>Philip found Nathaniel and said “Come and see!”</l><l>Nathaniel said, “Lord, how do You know me?”</l><l>The Lord said, “I saw you under the fig tree.”</l><l> </l><l> “Follow Me! Follow Me!</l><l> Much greater things you shall see!</l><l> Follow Me! Follow Me!</l><l> Much greater things, much greater things, much greater things you shall see!”</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>One day the Lord found a young man named Saul</l><l>On the way to Damascus the Lord made him fall</l><l>The Lord said, “Saul, why do you persecute Me?</l><l>Come and follow Me!”</l><l> </l><l> Follow Me! Follow Me!</l><l> The Lord said, “Come follow Me!”</l><l> Follow Me! Follow Me!</l><l> “Lord we will follow, Lord we will follow, Lord we will follow Thee!”</l></lg>
</div>
</back></music></mei>
